This Service Agreement is entered into on {{date: 2026-07-01}} between {{party: acme}} and
{{party: delta}}.

# Definitions {#definitions}

"Services" {{def: services}} means the software maintenance services described in this Agreement.

"Effective Date" {{def: effective-date}} means {{date: 2026-07-01}}.

# Obligations of the Provider {#provider-obligations}

{{party: acme, label=the Provider}} shall perform the {{term: services}} from the
{{term: effective-date}} with reasonable skill and care.

# Fees {#fees}

The Client shall pay {{money: 4500, currency=EUR}} per month, invoiced monthly in arrears and
payable within {{duration: 30, unit=D}}.

# Term {#term}

This Agreement continues for {{duration: 12, unit=MO}} from the {{term: effective-date}} and
renews automatically unless either party gives {{duration: 60, unit=D}} written notice.

# Governing Language {#governing-language}

This Agreement is executed in English and French. In the event of any discrepancy, the English
version prevails.
